      "good": "The full-width Name column keeps identifiers intact, and the Required and Default columns have enough room for their longest values. Row boundaries provide a consistent structure for following each setting across the table.",
      "problems": "The initial viewport shows only the Name column, with long identifiers extending beyond its right edge. The rows are very tall, leaving large areas of empty space under most names and making the list harder to scan.",
